<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank said it has issued 80 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the DAX index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.AUG.97-16.DEC.98   PAYDATE	20.AUG.97</p>
<p>ONE INDEX IS CONTROLLED BY 100 WARRANTS.</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	     STRIKE	    ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	     4600		3.74 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	     4700		3.31 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	     4800		2.93 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	     4900		2.56 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		4100		3.83 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		4200		4.23 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		4300		4.68 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		4400		5.14 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
